---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="BeamCash Demo - SkanPay"
  description="BeamCash is the app-style SkanPay demo used to show seller QR setup, customer scan, and checkout approval in a concrete product flow."
  activePath="/beamcash-demo/"
>
  <section class="app-product-hero">
    <div>
      <div class="app-logo-block">
        <img src="/beamcash/beamcash-logo.svg" alt="BeamCash" />
      </div>
      <p class="page-label">Demo app under SkanPay</p>
      <h1>BeamCash turns the QR checkout concept into screens people can review.</h1>
      <p class="lead-copy">
        BeamCash is not the full SkanPay gateway. It is the demo app used to show seller QR display, customer scan, and checkout approval in a product-like flow.
      </p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button primary" href="#walkthrough">See the Flow</a>
        <a class="button ghost" href="/contact/">Request Demo</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="app-screen-hero" aria-label="BeamCash app screens">
      <img class="seller-screen" src="/beamcash/beamcash-seller-dashboard-mobile.png" alt="BeamCash seller dashboard with QR code and activity status" />
      <img class="buyer-screen" src="/beamcash/beamcash-buyer-checkout-mobile.png" alt="BeamCash buyer checkout screen with merchant profile and checkout amount" />
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="section demo-purpose">
    <div>
      <span>Why include BeamCash</span>
      <h2>SkanPay is the company and gateway invention. BeamCash is the proof surface.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      The demo gives merchants, banks, payment partners, and investors a concrete interface to discuss before deeper gateway requirements are defined.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section app-flow-section" id="walkthrough">
    <div class="business-heading">
      <span>Demo walkthrough</span>
      <h2>Display. Scan. Approve.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="app-flow-row">
      <div>
        <img src="/beamcash/beamcash-seller-dashboard-mobile.png" alt="BeamCash seller dashboard screen" />
        <span>01 / Seller</span>
        <h3>Display the QR surface</h3>
        <p>The seller has a visible code and status surface at the point of interaction.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <img src="/beamcash/beamcash-find-code-mobile.png" alt="BeamCash QR code lookup screen" />
        <span>02 / Customer</span>
        <h3>Scan the code</h3>
        <p>The customer opens the checkout request from the displayed QR surface.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <img src="/beamcash/beamcash-buyer-checkout-mobile.png" alt="BeamCash buyer checkout screen" />
        <span>03 / Approval</span>
        <h3>Review and approve</h3>
        <p>The buyer sees merchant and amount context before continuing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section demo-use-section">
    <div class="demo-use-copy">
      <span>Business use</span>
      <h2>Use BeamCash to make SkanPay conversations specific.</h2>
      <p>BeamCash helps a meeting move from "imagine QR checkout" to concrete questions about screens, states, handoffs, and partner roles.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="use-list">
      <div>
        <strong>Merchant review</strong>
        <p>What does staff see when a customer scans?</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>Customer review</strong>
        <p>Does the buyer have enough context to approve?</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>Partner review</strong>
        <p>Where do wallet, bank, loyalty, gateway, and processor responsibilities sit?</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section boundary-section">
    <div>
      <span>Important boundary</span>
      <h2>BeamCash is the demo. SkanPay is the gateway.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      The BeamCash page does not claim live processing. It demonstrates the user-facing flow SkanPay can use when speaking with merchants, banks, wallets, loyalty partners, and investors.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="business-cta">
    <div>
      <span>Next step</span>
      <h2>Review BeamCash in a SkanPay conversation.</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="button primary" href="/contact/">Request a Conversation</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
